Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Site Pages Administration|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Pages Administration|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Page From Existing Page
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When Page add
		|pageName|Site Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Site Page|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|pageTemplateName|Content Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Tags Navigation|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Categories Navigation|
	Then Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|

Scenario: Delete Pages
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Page1|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Page2|
	And Page delete PG
		|pageName|Page1|
	And Page view Deleted Page
		|pageName|Page1|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page delete Via X
		|pageName|Page2|
	Then Page view Deleted Page
		|pageName|Page2|

Scenario: Edit Site Page
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When Page add
		|pageName|Site Page|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Site Page|
	And Page edit Name
		|pageNameEdit|Site Page Edit|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Site Page Edit|
	Then Page view
		|pageName|Site Page Edit|